From: IMD Ember <operator@imdember.invalid>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:24:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/18] Staking pane: gold 'confirming' stake on the miner, no
 3D viewer, disabled button says why

Owner requests 2026-10-27. (1) A mined stake waits about 15 minutes for the finalized ledger: the miner now shows it in gold as 'Confirming: +N EMBEO' and an empty miner as 'Starting' until a ledger position with those shares appears (display only, per wallet in this browser, 2 h cap; rewards still come from the finalized position, which starts on the next UTC day). (2) The 3D viewer and its 'View 3D' button are removed; a running miner plays its film when miningAssets.json lists one ('videos', owner-provided, muted loop, image under reduced motion), otherwise the image. (3) The stake button's disabled state is explained (unconfirmed earlier transaction, ledger syncing, paused, wallet/account mismatch, signed out).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
